.SS "DWORD stumpless_remove_wel_event_source (LPCSTR subkey_name, LPCSTR source_name)"

.PP
Removes the registry entries for an event source for the Windows Event Log\&. \fBThread Safety: MT-Safe race:subkey_name race:source_name\fP This function is thread safe, of course assuming that the string parameters are not changed during execution\&.
.PP
